$ Fully explicit quadruplet transfer over the full circle (QUADRUPLET 8)
$
$ IQUAD = 8 is its own arm of the source-term dispatcher in SWCOMP and was a
$ declared formulation that no deck selected.
$
$ The default cap of 50 iterations is just short: this deck settles around
$ iteration 55.
PROJECT 'QUADFULL' '001'
SET CARTESIAN
MODE STATIONARY ONEDIMENSIONAL
COORDINATES CARTESIAN

CGRID REGULAR 0.0 0.0 0.0 100000.0 0.0 40 0 &
      CIRCLE 36 0.04 1.0 34
INPGRID BOTTOM REGULAR 0.0 0.0 0.0 1 0 100000.0 1.0
READINP BOTTOM 1.0 'bottom.bot' 1 0 FREE

WIND 15.0 0.0
BOUND SHAPESPEC JONSWAP 3.3 PEAK DSPR DEGREES
BOUNDSPEC SIDE WEST CONSTANT PAR 0.05 2.0 0.0 20.0

GEN3 WESTH
QUADRUPLET 8
OFF BREAKING

POINTS 'GAUGES' 0.0 0.0 25000.0 0.0 50000.0 0.0 &
         75000.0 0.0 100000.0 0.0
TABLE 'GAUGES' HEADER 'quad_full.tbl' XP DEPTH HSIGN TM01 RTP REDTRIAD REDQUAD
SPECOUT 'GAUGES' SPEC1D ABS 'quad_full.spc'
TEST 1 0 POINTS XY 50000.0 0.0 S1D 'quad_full_sources.spc'

NUMERIC STOPC STAT MXITST=100

COMPUTE
STOP
